.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH cursor-session 1  "cursor-session 0.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cursor\-session \- List, show, and export Cursor IDE and Agent CLI chat sessions
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcursor\-session\fR [\fB\-\-storage\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
List, show, and export Cursor IDE and Agent CLI chat sessions.
.PP
Reads two local stores and never writes to them:
.RS 4
.nf
Agent CLI  ~/.cursor/chats plus transcripts in ~/.cursor/projects/*/agent\-transcripts
IDE        Cursor/User/globalStorage/state.vscdb in Cursor\*(Aqs config directory
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH "GLOBAL OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-storage\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Read only this location: a home, .cursor, chats, workspace, session or projects directory, a store.db or state.vscdb file, or the directory that holds state.vscdb
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print the storage paths in use and the rows and files that were skipped to stderr
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
When to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
cursor\-session\-list(1)
List sessions, most recently updated first
.TP
cursor\-session\-show(1)
Show messages from a session
.TP
cursor\-session\-export(1)
Export sessions to files
.TP
cursor\-session\-healthcheck(1)
Check that session stores can be found and loaded
.TP
cursor\-session\-completions(1)
Print a shell completion script
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS 4
.nf
cursor\-session list
cursor\-session list \-\-source agent \-\-limit 10
cursor\-session show f4eea6d2
cursor\-session show f4eea6d2 \-\-json | jq \-r \*(Aq.messages[].content\*(Aq
cursor\-session export \-\-format md \-\-session\-id f4eea6d2
.fi
.RE
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.RS 4
.nf
0  Success, also when output is cut short by a closed pipe (e.g. `| head`)
1  Error: session not found, unreadable storage, failed healthcheck
2  Usage error: unknown command or flag, invalid value
.fi
.RE
.SH VERSION
v0.3.0
